{
  "name": "RCA",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RCA Workflow\n\nRuns root cause analysis on a Jira ticket and posts the result as a Jira comment automatically.\n\n**Input format:**\n`service: TICKET-KEY`\n\n**Examples:**\n```\nrover-ifc: CICO-134027\nibe: IBE-1152\npms: PMS-456\n```\n\nOptionally add context after the ticket key:\n```\nrover-ifc: CICO-134027 focus on the channex rate exporter\n```\n\n**Requires:** AWS Bedrock credentials and Jira API token configured in codebot `.env`.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-380, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "s1",
      "name": "Chat Trigger",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "webhookId": "jira-rca-simple"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8000/rca",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "input", "value": "={{ $json.chatInput }}" },
            { "name": "session_id", "value": "" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "s2",
      "name": "Ask codebot RCA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "return { output: $('Ask codebot RCA').item.json.output };"
      },
      "id": "s3",
      "name": "Respond to Chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Chat Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Ask codebot RCA", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Ask codebot RCA": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Respond to Chat", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
